## 6. Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Install Flutter dependencies
flutter pub get

# 2. Install function dependencies
cd functions && npm install

# 3. Install seed-script dependencies
cd ../scripts && npm install

# 4. Run the app
flutter run
```

### Enable Firebase Storage (Spark plan)

```bash
firebase deploy --only storage:rules
firebase deploy --only firestore:rules
```

### Seed Demo Data

```bash
cd scripts
npm run seed
```

### Deploy Web Hosting

```bash
flutter build web
firebase deploy --only hosting
```

### Deploy Cloud Functions (requires Blaze)

```bash
cd functions
npm run build
firebase deploy --only functions
```

